    source:{ name:"Pacing the Frontier", handle:"pacingthefrontier.com", platform:"web", kind:"news" },
    text:"Over **1,178 employees** across OpenAI, Anthropic, Google DeepMind and Meta — including Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei, several of its co-founders, and OpenAI chief scientist Jakub Pachocki — signed **'Pacing the Frontier,'** an open letter asking the US government to help build international tools for a coordinated slowdown of AI development if capability growth ever outpaces the ability to oversee it. Anthropic and OpenAI both endorsed it as companies within hours.",
